```
4) Data-flow diagram:
```mermaid
flowchart LR
  Step1["Raw Data"] --> Step2["Feature Extractor"] --> Step3["Fusion"] --> Step4["Output"]
```
5) System architecture diagram:
```mermaid
flowchart LR
  Host["Host"] --> FPGA["FPGA / Accelerator"] --> Mem["Memory / IO"]
```
6) Trade-off diagram:
```mermaid
flowchart TD
